Package: libgrapheme-dev
Version: @DEB_LIBGRAPHEME_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://libs.suckless.org/libgrapheme/
Description: Unicode string segmentation library (static)
 libgrapheme is a small, freestanding C library implementing the Unicode text
 segmentation algorithms (grapheme clusters, words, sentences, line breaks) and
 case conversion. Ships the static archive, header, and pkg-config file; imv
 links it statically for its Unicode backend.
